{"content_hash": "5f282258a223bb33", "version_id": 1053, "article_id": 107, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Xiaomi's Mijia Smart Fish Tank 2 Pro brings bigger tank and easier care", "title_zh": "小米米家智能鱼缸2 Pro带来更大缸体和更轻松的养护", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/119023", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571008887538-b36bb32f4571?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8cHJvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTU0OTc5NDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by sporlab on Unsplash", "author": "sporlab", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@sporlab?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/pair-of-blue-and-white-adidas-running-shoes-XiZ7pRvCzro?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(206, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(244, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "4886abeeaa35"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-24", "word_count": 149, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "Xiaomi has launched the Mijia Smart Fish Tank 2 Pro, a larger and smarter version of its first tank. The new model offers more space for plants and fish, plus better filtering and lighting for beginners.", "lead_zh": "小米推出了米家智能鱼缸2 Pro，这是其首款鱼缸的更大、更智能版本。新机型为水草和鱼提供了更多空间，并为新手提供了更好的过滤和照明。", "preview": "The 2 Pro holds about 30 litres of water, up from 20 litres in the first model. Although the tank is only slightly wider and taller, owners ", "preview_zh": "2 Pro可容纳约30升水，高于第一代机型的20升。虽然鱼缸只是稍微加宽加高，但用户有了更多空间来搭建水下景观。不过，装满水的鱼缸更重，因此你应确认你的书桌或柜子能承受这个重量。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1036, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 48.85, "size_bytes": 294048, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 169, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@03411fdf/content/data/versions/1053.json", "paragraphs": ["The 2 Pro holds about 30 litres of water, up from 20 litres in the first model. Although the tank is only slightly wider and taller, owners get much more room to build underwater scenes. However, a full tank is heavier, so you should check that your desk or cabinet can hold the weight.", "The filter now sits on top and keeps solid waste out of the water. Because the pump is stronger, water flow and oxygen levels are much higher than before. The lighting is also brighter, and a small spotlight highlights rocks and plants to create a dramatic look.", "Through the Mijia app, users can control the light, pump and automatic feeder, or ask Xiaoai to do it. The app can also suggest settings based on the fish you choose. Still, some problems remain, such as fog on the glass and harder cleaning in a few areas."], "paragraphs_zh": ["2 Pro可容纳约30升水，高于第一代机型的20升。虽然鱼缸只是稍微加宽加高，但用户有了更多空间来搭建水下景观。不过，装满水的鱼缸更重，因此你应确认你的书桌或柜子能承受这个重量。", "过滤器现在位于顶部，可将固体废物挡在水外。由于水泵更强劲，水流和氧气水平比之前高得多。照明也更亮，一个小聚光灯照亮石头和水草，营造出戏剧性的效果。", "通过米家应用，用户可以控制灯光、水泵和自动喂食器，或让小爱来完成。该应用还可以根据你选择的鱼推荐设置。不过，一些问题仍然存在，例如玻璃起雾以及少数区域较难清洁。"], "body": "The 2 Pro holds about 30 litres of water, up from 20 litres in the first model. Although the tank is only slightly wider and taller, owners get much more room to build underwater scenes. However, a full tank is heavier, so you should check that your desk or cabinet can hold the weight.\n\nThe filter now sits on top and keeps solid waste out of the water. Because the pump is stronger, water flow and oxygen levels are much higher than before. The lighting is also brighter, and a small spotlight highlights rocks and plants to create a dramatic look.\n\nThrough the Mijia app, users can control the light, pump and automatic feeder, or ask Xiaoai to do it. The app can also suggest settings based on the fish you choose. Still, some problems remain, such as fog on the glass and harder cleaning in a few areas.", "body_zh": "2 Pro可容纳约30升水，高于第一代机型的20升。虽然鱼缸只是稍微加宽加高，但用户有了更多空间来搭建水下景观。不过，装满水的鱼缸更重，因此你应确认你的书桌或柜子能承受这个重量。\n\n过滤器现在位于顶部，可将固体废物挡在水外。由于水泵更强劲，水流和氧气水平比之前高得多。照明也更亮，一个小聚光灯照亮石头和水草，营造出戏剧性的效果。\n\n通过米家应用，用户可以控制灯光、水泵和自动喂食器，或让小爱来完成。该应用还可以根据你选择的鱼推荐设置。不过，一些问题仍然存在，例如玻璃起雾以及少数区域较难清洁。", "text": "The 2 Pro holds about 30 litres of water, up from 20 litres in the first model. Although the tank is only slightly wider and taller, owners get much more room to build underwater scenes. However, a full tank is heavier, so you should check that your desk or cabinet can hold the weight. The filter now sits on top and keeps solid waste out of the water. Because the pump is stronger, water flow and oxygen levels are much higher than before. The lighting is also brighter, and a small spotlight highlights rocks and plants to create a dramatic look. Through the Mijia app, users can control the light, pump and automatic feeder, or ask Xiaoai to do it. The app can also suggest settings based on the fish you choose. Still, some problems remain, such as fog on the glass and harder cleaning in a few areas.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "推出", "note": "常用语新产品发布", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "litre", "pos": "noun", "zh": "升", "note": "容量单位", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "filter", "pos": "noun", "zh": "过滤器", "note": "养鱼设备核心部件", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pump", "pos": "noun", "zh": "水泵", "note": "推动水流", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spotlight", "pos": "noun", "zh": "射灯", "note": "局部照明", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "automatic", "pos": "adj", "zh": "自动的", "note": "automatic feeder 自动喂食器", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "suggest", "pos": "verb", "zh": "建议", "note": "suggest settings 推荐设置", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fog", "pos": "noun", "zh": "雾气", "note": "玻璃起雾", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "weight", "pos": "noun", "zh": "重量", "note": "承重相关", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "remain", "pos": "verb", "zh": "仍然存在",